<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Co raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Co raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday it had raised its rating for Sun Co to near- and long-term accumulate from near- and long-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- The petroleum refining company's stock opened up 3/4 to 23-1/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
